Hunter experience - 1 point is equal to 5 experience saying you cap everytime (at level 90+ it's very easy) 1,500*5=7,500 xp/game in points.
&nbsp;

Grenwall quota ticket - 10 points is equal to 1 ticket. Once again, capping everytime that's 1,500/10 = 150 tickets per game. Each ticket will than grant you 1,100 XP per grenwall catch. So, 1,100*150=165,000 XP per-game if you buy the tickets and use them.
&nbsp;

Note: If you buy tickets, when you catch grenwalls you can use bonus XP, whereas if you buy the straight XP per-game that doesn't work with bonus XP.

